# Cloudflare Pages — canonical redirect rules
# Rules are first-match. Most specific first.

# www + .html in one hop (must be before the www wildcard)
https://www.designintend.com/*.html  https://designintend.com/:splat  301!

# Force www to non-www (site-wide canonical)
